{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object. If visible, approach, take and check properties. Do specific task. Return to starting point.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToStartingPoint    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNear    />\"",
